---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout 
  title="¿Tiene Memoria la Ruleta?" 
  description="Experimenta con patrones y rachas en la ruleta. Descubre por qué los resultados pasados no pueden predecir los futuros."
>
  
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-600 via-indigo-700 to-purple-800 text-white py-12">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">
          🧠 ¿Tiene Memoria la Ruleta?
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl mb-6 text-purple-100">
          Investiga patrones y rachas para descubrir 
          <span class="text-yellow-300 font-semibold">por qué cada giro es completamente independiente</span>
        </p>
        <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg p-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          <p class="text-purple-100">
            🔬 <strong>Experimento científico:</strong> La falacia del jugador al descubierto
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Experiment -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      
      <!-- Explanation of What the Simulator Does -->
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-center text-gray-900 mb-6">🤖 ¿Qué hace este simulador?</h2>
          
          <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-6 mb-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-yellow-800 mb-3">⚠️ Atención: Este simulador IMITA el pensamiento erróneo</h3>
            <p class="text-yellow-700 mb-3">
              Nuestro simulador actuará como un jugador que cree en patrones y tratará de predecir 
              el próximo resultado basándose en los anteriores. <strong>Esto es exactamente lo que NO debes hacer.</strong>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-red-800 mb-3">❌ Predicciones que verás (ERRÓNEAS)</h4>
              <ul class="text-red-700 space-y-2 text-sm">
                <li><strong>"Después de 3 rojos, es más probable negro"</strong><br>
                <span class="text-xs text-red-600">Pensamiento: Las rachas deben romperse</span></li>
                <li><strong>"Hay más rojos recientemente, debe equilibrarse"</strong><br>
                <span class="text-xs text-red-600">Pensamiento: Los colores se "compensan"</span></li>
                <li><strong>"Después de 5 negros seguidos, es más probable rojo"</strong><br>
                <span class="text-xs text-red-600">Pensamiento: La ruleta "debe" alternar</span></li>
                <li><strong>"El patrón sugiere que viene negro"</strong><br>
                <span class="text-xs text-red-600">Pensamiento: Los resultados siguen patrones</span></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-green-800 mb-3">✅ La realidad matemática</h4>
              <ul class="text-green-700 space-y-2 text-sm">
                <li><strong>Cada giro es independiente</strong><br>
                <span class="text-xs text-green-600">Probabilidad fija: 48.65% rojo, 48.65% negro</span></li>
                <li><strong>No hay "equilibrio cósmico"</strong><br>
                <span class="text-xs text-green-600">Los resultados pasados no afectan los futuros</span></li>
                <li><strong>Las rachas son completamente normales</strong><br>
                <span class="text-xs text-green-600">En secuencias aleatorias aparecen rachas largas</span></li>
                <li><strong>No existen patrones predecibles</strong><br>
                <span class="text-xs text-green-600">Solo existe aleatoriedad pura</span></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg p-6 text-center">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-blue-800 mb-2">🎯 Objetivo del Experimento</h4>
            <p class="text-blue-700 text-sm">
              Verás cómo el simulador falla constantemente en sus predicciones "lógicas". 
              Esto demuestra que <strong>la falacia del jugador arruina a millones de personas</strong> 
              que creen poder predecir lo impredecible.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Roulette Type Selector -->
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-8">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 text-center">Tipo de Ruleta</h2>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
            <button id="europeanBtn" class="flex-1 max-w-xs mx-auto bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 active-roulette">
              🇪🇺 Europea (37 números)
              <div class="text-sm opacity-90">Cero: 0</div>
            </button>
            <button id="americanBtn" class="flex-1 max-w-xs mx-auto bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-all duration-200">
              🇺🇸 Americana (38 números)
              <div class="text-sm opacity-90">Ceros: 0, 00</div>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Roulette Wheel and Controls -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-2">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6">
            
            <!-- Roulette Wheel -->
            <div class="text-center mb-8">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6 border-4 border-gray-800">
                <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🎲 Laboratorio de Independencia</h4>
                
                <!-- Roulette Strip Container -->
                <div class="relative h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-700 via-gray-800 to-gray-700 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border-4 border-gray-800 mx-auto">
                  <!-- Pointer -->
                  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 z-30">
                    <div class="w-0 h-0 border-l-4 border-r-4 border-b-8 border-l-transparent border-r-transparent border-b-yellow-400 drop-shadow-lg"></div>
                  </div>
                  
                  <!-- Moving strip -->
                  <div id="rouletteStrip" class="absolute top-2 h-16 flex items-center transition-transform duration-3000 ease-out" style="width: max-content;">
                    <!-- Numbers will be generated here -->
                  </div>
                  
                  <!-- Center line indicator -->
                  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 w-0.5 h-full bg-yellow-400 z-20 opacity-75"></div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Result Display -->
                <div class="mt-6">
                  <div id="lastResult" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">-</div>
                  <div id="lastResultColor" class="text-lg text-gray-600">Gira para comenzar el experimento</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pattern Prediction -->
                <div id="predictionBox" class="mt-4 p-4 bg-yellow-50 border-2 border-yellow-200 rounded-lg hidden">
                  <h5 class="font-bold text-yellow-800 mb-2">🔮 Predicción Basada en Patrones</h5>
                  <p id="predictionText" class="text-yellow-700 text-sm mb-2">
                    Después de 4 rojos seguidos, el próximo DEBE ser negro...
                  </p>
                  <div id="predictionResult" class="font-bold text-lg">
                    <!-- Prediction result will appear here -->
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Controls -->
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 mb-6">
              <button id="spinBtn" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-indigo-700 hover:from-purple-700 hover:to-indigo-800 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 transform hover:scale-105">
                🎰 GIRAR
              </button>
              <button id="spin50Btn" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-all duration-200">
                ⚡ 50 Giros Rápidos
              </button>
              <button id="analyzeBtn" class="bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-all duration-200">
                🔍 Analizar Patrones
              </button>
              <button id="resetBtn" class="bg-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-lg transition-all duration-200">
                🔄 Reset
              </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Pattern Analysis Results -->
            <div id="analysisResults" class="border-t pt-6 hidden">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">🔬 Resultados del Análisis</h3>
              <div id="analysisContent" class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4">
                <!-- Analysis results will appear here -->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pattern Tracking -->
        <div class="space-y-6">
          
          <!-- Recent Results History -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📜 Historial Reciente</h3>
            <div class="mb-4">
              <h4 class="font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Últimos 20 resultados:</h4>
              <div id="recentHistory" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="text-gray-400">Esperando resultados...</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600">
              <p><span class="text-red-600">●</span> Rojo • <span class="text-gray-800">●</span> Negro • <span class="text-green-600">●</span> Verde</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Streak Counter -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🔥 Contador de Rachas</h3>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-gray-600">Racha actual:</span>
                <span id="currentStreak" class="font-bold text-lg">-</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-gray-600">Racha más larga (rojo):</span>
                <span id="longestRedStreak" class="font-bold text-red-600">0</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-gray-600">Racha más larga (negro):</span>
                <span id="longestBlackStreak" class="font-bold text-gray-800">0</span>
              </div>
              <div class="border-t pt-2">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                  <span class="text-gray-600">Total giros:</span>
                  <span id="totalSpins" class="font-bold">0</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Independence Test -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🧪 Test de Independencia</h3>
            <div id="independenceTest" class="space-y-2 text-sm">
              <p class="text-gray-500">Gira al menos 50 veces para ver el análisis</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Gambler's Fallacy Counter -->
          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-4">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-red-800 mb-2">🚨 Detector de Falacia</h4>
            <div id="fallacyDetector" class="space-y-2 text-sm">
              <div class="flex justify-between">
                <span class="text-red-700">Predicciones fallidas:</span>
                <span id="wrongPredictions" class="font-bold text-red-600">0</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between">
                <span class="text-red-700">% Error en predicciones:</span>
                <span id="predictionErrorRate" class="font-bold text-red-600">-%</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Educational Content -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-gray-900 mb-8">📚 Ejemplos Reales de la Falacia</h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-6">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">🎰 Casino de Monte Carlo (1913)</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-3">
              El negro salió 26 veces seguidas. Los jugadores perdieron millones apostando al rojo, 
              convencidos de que "debía salir". Al final de la noche, seguía siendo 48.65% para ambos.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-red-100 border border-red-200 rounded p-2">
              <p class="text-red-600 text-xs font-bold">
                Resultado: Millones perdidos por no entender la independencia estadística
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-6">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">📊 Experimento con Monedas</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-3">
              Si lanzas una moneda justa 1000 veces y salen 60% caras, el siguiente lanzamiento 
              sigue siendo exactamente 50% probabilidad para cada lado. La moneda no "debe" compensar.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-blue-100 border border-blue-200 rounded p-2">
              <p class="text-blue-600 text-xs font-bold">
                Lección: Los eventos pasados no alteran probabilidades futuras
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-8 bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-6 text-center">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-800 mb-3">🚨 Conclusión Final</h3>
          <p class="text-red-700 mb-3">
            La falacia del jugador ha arruinado más fortunas que cualquier sistema de apuestas. 
            <strong>Cada giro es independiente, sin memoria del pasado.</strong>
          </p>
          <div class="bg-white rounded p-3 inline-block">
            <p id="finalProbabilities" class="text-red-800 font-bold text-lg">
              Probabilidad fija siempre: 48.65% rojo • 48.65% negro • 2.7% verde
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</MainLayout>

<script>
class RouletteMemoryExperiment {
  constructor() {
    this.isEuropean = true;
    this.results = [];
    this.predictions = [];
    this.wrongPredictions = 0;
    this.currentStreak = { type: null, count: 0 };
    this.longestStreaks = { red: 0, black: 0 };
    this.totalSpins = 0;
    
    this.initializeElements();
    this.createWheel();
    this.attachEventListeners();
    this.updateDisplay();
  }

  initializeElements() {
    this.elements = {
      europeanBtn: document.getElementById('europeanBtn'),
      americanBtn: document.getElementById('americanBtn'),
      rouletteWheel: document.getElementById('rouletteStrip'),
      lastResult: document.getElementById('lastResult'),
      lastResultColor: document.getElementById('lastResultColor'),
      spinBtn: document.getElementById('spinBtn'),
      spin50Btn: document.getElementById('spin50Btn'),
      analyzeBtn: document.getElementById('analyzeBtn'),
      resetBtn: document.getElementById('resetBtn'),
      predictionBox: document.getElementById('predictionBox'),
      predictionText: document.getElementById('predictionText'),
      predictionResult: document.getElementById('predictionResult'),
      recentHistory: document.getElementById('recentHistory'),
      currentStreak: document.getElementById('currentStreak'),
      longestRedStreak: document.getElementById('longestRedStreak'),
      longestBlackStreak: document.getElementById('longestBlackStreak'),
      totalSpins: document.getElementById('totalSpins'),
      independenceTest: document.getElementById('independenceTest'),
      wrongPredictions: document.getElementById('wrongPredictions'),
      predictionErrorRate: document.getElementById('predictionErrorRate'),
      analysisResults: document.getElementById('analysisResults'),
      analysisContent: document.getElementById('analysisContent')
    };
  }

  attachEventListeners() {
    this.elements.europeanBtn.addEventListener('click', () => this.setRouletteType(true));
    this.elements.americanBtn.addEventListener('click', () => this.setRouletteType(false));
    this.elements.spinBtn.addEventListener('click', () => this.spin());
    this.elements.spin50Btn.addEventListener('click', () => this.spin50());
    this.elements.analyzeBtn.addEventListener('click', () => this.analyzePatterns());
    this.elements.resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => this.reset());
  }

  setRouletteType(isEuropean) {
    this.isEuropean = isEuropean;
    
    if (isEuropean) {
      this.elements.europeanBtn.classList.add('active-roulette');
      this.elements.americanBtn.classList.remove('active-roulette');
    } else {
      this.elements.americanBtn.classList.add('active-roulette');
      this.elements.europeanBtn.classList.remove('active-roulette');
    }
    
    // Update final probabilities text
    const finalProbText = document.getElementById('finalProbabilities');
    if (finalProbText) {
      if (isEuropean) {
        finalProbText.textContent = 'Probabilidad fija siempre: 48.65% rojo • 48.65% negro • 2.7% verde';
      } else {
        finalProbText.textContent = 'Probabilidad fija siempre: 47.37% rojo • 47.37% negro • 5.26% verde';
      }
    }
    
    this.createWheel();
    this.reset();
  }

  createWheel() {
    const strip = document.getElementById('rouletteStrip');
    strip.innerHTML = '';
    
    this.numbers = this.isEuropean ? 
      [0, 32, 15, 19, 4, 21, 2, 25, 17, 34, 6, 27, 13, 36, 11, 30, 8, 23, 10, 5, 24, 16, 33, 1, 20, 14, 31, 9, 22, 18, 29, 7, 28, 12, 35, 3, 26] :
      [0, 28, 9, 26, 30, 11, 7, 20, 32, 17, 5, 22, 34, 15, 3, 24, 36, 13, 1, 37, 27, 10, 25, 29, 12, 8, 19, 31, 18, 6, 21, 33, 16, 4, 23, 35, 14, 2];
    
    const repetitions = 8;
    const allNumbers = [];
    for (let i = 0; i < repetitions; i++) {
      allNumbers.push(...this.numbers);
    }
    
    this.segmentWidth = 80;
    
    allNumbers.forEach((number) => {
      const segment = document.createElement('div');
      segment.className = 'flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center border-r border-white font-bold text-white text-xl';
      segment.style.width = this.segmentWidth + 'px';
      segment.style.height = '64px';
      
      let bgColor;
      if (number === 0 || number === 37) {
        bgColor = '#059669';
      } else {
        const redNumbers = [1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 12, 14, 16, 18, 19, 21, 23, 25, 27, 30, 32, 34, 36];
        bgColor = redNumbers.includes(number) ? '#dc2626' : '#1f2937';
      }
      
      segment.style.backgroundColor = bgColor;
      segment.textContent = number === 37 ? '00' : number;
      
      strip.appendChild(segment);
    });
    
    this.totalSegments = allNumbers.length;
    this.originalNumbersLength = this.numbers.length;
    
    strip.style.transform = 'translateX(0px)';
  }

  spin() {
    this.elements.spinBtn.disabled = true;
    
    const maxNumber = this.isEuropean ? 36 : 37;
    const result = Math.floor(Math.random() * (maxNumber + 1));
    const displayResult = result === 37 ? '00' : result;
    
    // Make prediction before spin result
    const prediction = this.makePrediction();
    
    // Animate wheel
    const resultIndex = this.numbers.indexOf(result);
    const targetRepetition = 4;
    const targetSegmentIndex = targetRepetition * this.originalNumbersLength + resultIndex;
    const container = document.getElementById('rouletteStrip').parentElement;
    const containerWidth = container.clientWidth;
    const targetPosition = targetSegmentIndex * this.segmentWidth;
    const centerOffset = containerWidth / 2 - this.segmentWidth / 2;
    const extraDistance = this.originalNumbersLength * this.segmentWidth * 3;
    const finalPosition = -(targetPosition - centerOffset + extraDistance);
    
    const strip = document.getElementById('rouletteStrip');
    strip.style.transform = `translateX(${finalPosition}px)`;
    
    setTimeout(() => {
      this.processResult(result, displayResult, prediction);
      this.elements.spinBtn.disabled = false;
    }, 3000);
  }

  async spin50() {
    this.elements.spin50Btn.disabled = true;
    this.elements.spin50Btn.textContent = 'Girando...';
    
    for (let i = 0; i < 50; i++) {
      const maxNumber = this.isEuropean ? 36 : 37;
      const result = Math.floor(Math.random() * (maxNumber + 1));
      const displayResult = result === 37 ? '00' : result;
      const prediction = this.makePrediction();
      
      this.processResult(result, displayResult, prediction);
      
      // Update display every 5 spins
      if (i % 5 === 0) {
        this.updateDisplay();
        await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 50));
      }
    }
    
    this.updateDisplay();
    this.elements.spin50Btn.disabled = false;
    this.elements.spin50Btn.textContent = '⚡ 50 Giros Rápidos';
  }

  makePrediction() {
    if (this.results.length < 3) return null;
    
    const lastResults = this.results.slice(-5);
    const redNumbers = [1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 12, 14, 16, 18, 19, 21, 23, 25, 27, 30, 32, 34, 36];
    
    // Count recent colors
    let recentColors = lastResults.map(r => {
      if (r === 0 || r === 37) return 'green';
      return redNumbers.includes(r) ? 'red' : 'black';
    });
    
    // Simple pattern-based prediction logic
    let prediction = null;
    let reason = '';
    
    if (recentColors.length >= 3) {
      const lastThree = recentColors.slice(-3);
      if (lastThree.every(c => c === 'red')) {
        prediction = 'black';
        reason = `Después de ${lastThree.length} rojos seguidos, es más probable negro`;
      } else if (lastThree.every(c => c === 'black')) {
        prediction = 'red';
        reason = `Después de ${lastThree.length} negros seguidos, es más probable rojo`;
      } else if (recentColors.filter(c => c === 'red').length > recentColors.filter(c => c === 'black').length) {
        prediction = 'black';
        reason = 'Hay más rojos que negros recientemente, debe equilibrarse';
      } else if (recentColors.filter(c => c === 'black').length > recentColors.filter(c => c === 'red').length) {
        prediction = 'red';
        reason = 'Hay más negros que rojos recientemente, debe equilibrarse';
      }
    }
    
    return prediction ? { color: prediction, reason: reason } : null;
  }

  processResult(result, displayResult, prediction) {
    const redNumbers = [1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 12, 14, 16, 18, 19, 21, 23, 25, 27, 30, 32, 34, 36];
    
    // Determine result color
    let resultColor, colorText, colorClass;
    if (result === 0 || result === 37) {
      resultColor = 'green';
      colorText = result === 37 ? 'Doble Cero' : 'Cero';
      colorClass = 'text-green-600';
    } else {
      const isRed = redNumbers.includes(result);
      resultColor = isRed ? 'red' : 'black';
      colorText = isRed ? 'Rojo' : 'Negro';
      colorClass = isRed ? 'text-red-600' : 'text-gray-800';
    }
    
    // Update result display
    this.elements.lastResult.textContent = displayResult;
    this.elements.lastResult.className = `text-3xl font-bold ${colorClass} mb-2`;
    this.elements.lastResultColor.textContent = colorText;
    
    // Process prediction
    if (prediction && (resultColor === 'red' || resultColor === 'black')) {
      const correct = prediction.color === resultColor;
      if (!correct) this.wrongPredictions++;
      
      this.elements.predictionBox.classList.remove('hidden');
      this.elements.predictionText.textContent = prediction.reason;
      this.elements.predictionResult.innerHTML = correct ? 
        `<span class="text-green-600">✅ ¡Predicción correcta!</span>` :
        `<span class="text-red-600">❌ Predicción fallida - Salió ${colorText}</span>`;
      
      this.predictions.push({ predicted: prediction.color, actual: resultColor, correct });
    }
    
    // Add to results
    this.results.push(result);
    this.totalSpins++;
    
    // Update streaks
    this.updateStreaks(resultColor);
    
    // Keep only last 1000 results for performance
    if (this.results.length > 1000) {
      this.results = this.results.slice(-1000);
    }
    
    this.updateDisplay();
  }

  updateStreaks(resultColor) {
    if (resultColor === 'green') {
      this.currentStreak = { type: 'green', count: 1 };
      return;
    }
    
    if (this.currentStreak.type === resultColor) {
      this.currentStreak.count++;
    } else {
      this.currentStreak = { type: resultColor, count: 1 };
    }
    
    if (resultColor === 'red' && this.currentStreak.count > this.longestStreaks.red) {
      this.longestStreaks.red = this.currentStreak.count;
    } else if (resultColor === 'black' && this.currentStreak.count > this.longestStreaks.black) {
      this.longestStreaks.black = this.currentStreak.count;
    }
  }

  updateDisplay() {
    // Update history
    const last20 = this.results.slice(-20);
    const redNumbers = [1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 12, 14, 16, 18, 19, 21, 23, 25, 27, 30, 32, 34, 36];
    
    this.elements.recentHistory.innerHTML = last20.length === 0 ? 
      '<span class="text-gray-400">Esperando resultados...</span>' :
      last20.map(result => {
        let color, symbol;
        if (result === 0 || result === 37) {
          color = 'text-green-600';
          symbol = '●';
        } else if (redNumbers.includes(result)) {
          color = 'text-red-600';
          symbol = '●';
        } else {
          color = 'text-gray-800';
          symbol = '●';
        }
        
        return `<span class="${color} text-lg" title="${result === 37 ? '00' : result}">${symbol}</span>`;
      }).join('');
    
    // Update streak info
    this.elements.currentStreak.textContent = this.currentStreak.type ? 
      `${this.currentStreak.count} ${this.currentStreak.type === 'red' ? 'Rojos' : this.currentStreak.type === 'black' ? 'Negros' : 'Verde'}` : 
      '-';
    this.elements.longestRedStreak.textContent = this.longestStreaks.red;
    this.elements.longestBlackStreak.textContent = this.longestStreaks.black;
    this.elements.totalSpins.textContent = this.totalSpins;
    
    // Update independence test
    if (this.totalSpins >= 50) {
      this.updateIndependenceTest();
    }
    
    // Update fallacy detector
    this.elements.wrongPredictions.textContent = this.wrongPredictions;
    const errorRate = this.predictions.length > 0 ? 
      ((this.wrongPredictions / this.predictions.length) * 100).toFixed(1) : 
      0;
    this.elements.predictionErrorRate.textContent = `${errorRate}%`;
  }

  updateIndependenceTest() {
    const redNumbers = [1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 12, 14, 16, 18, 19, 21, 23, 25, 27, 30, 32, 34, 36];
    
    // Calculate expected percentages based on roulette type
    const expectedRed = this.isEuropean ? 48.65 : 47.37;
    const expectedBlack = this.isEuropean ? 48.65 : 47.37;
    const expectedGreen = this.isEuropean ? 2.70 : 5.26;
    
    // Analyze patterns after streaks
    let afterRed = { red: 0, black: 0, green: 0 };
    let afterBlack = { red: 0, black: 0, green: 0 };
    
    for (let i = 1; i < this.results.length; i++) {
      const prev = this.results[i-1];
      const curr = this.results[i];
      
      const prevColor = (prev === 0 || prev === 37) ? 'green' : 
                       redNumbers.includes(prev) ? 'red' : 'black';
      const currColor = (curr === 0 || curr === 37) ? 'green' : 
                       redNumbers.includes(curr) ? 'red' : 'black';
      
      if (prevColor === 'red') {
        afterRed[currColor]++;
      } else if (prevColor === 'black') {
        afterBlack[currColor]++;
      }
    }
    
    const totalAfterRed = afterRed.red + afterRed.black + afterRed.green;
    const totalAfterBlack = afterBlack.red + afterBlack.black + afterBlack.green;
    
    this.elements.independenceTest.innerHTML = `
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div>
          <h5 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Después de ROJO salió:</h5>
          <div class="text-xs space-y-1">
            <div>• Rojo: ${totalAfterRed > 0 ? ((afterRed.red / totalAfterRed) * 100).toFixed(1) : 0}% (esperado: ${expectedRed}%)</div>
            <div>• Negro: ${totalAfterRed > 0 ? ((afterRed.black / totalAfterRed) * 100).toFixed(1) : 0}% (esperado: ${expectedBlack}%)</div>
            <div>• Verde: ${totalAfterRed > 0 ? ((afterRed.green / totalAfterRed) * 100).toFixed(1) : 0}% (esperado: ${expectedGreen}%)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h5 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Después de NEGRO salió:</h5>
          <div class="text-xs space-y-1">
            <div>• Rojo: ${totalAfterBlack > 0 ? ((afterBlack.red / totalAfterBlack) * 100).toFixed(1) : 0}% (esperado: ${expectedRed}%)</div>
            <div>• Negro: ${totalAfterBlack > 0 ? ((afterBlack.black / totalAfterBlack) * 100).toFixed(1) : 0}% (esperado: ${expectedBlack}%)</div>
            <div>• Verde: ${totalAfterBlack > 0 ? ((afterBlack.green / totalAfterBlack) * 100).toFixed(1) : 0}% (esperado: ${expectedGreen}%)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t pt-2 text-xs text-gray-600">
          <strong>Conclusión:</strong> Los valores se acercan a lo esperado, demostrando independencia.
        </div>
      </div>
    `;
  }

  analyzePatterns() {
    if (this.totalSpins < 20) {
      alert('Necesitas al menos 20 giros para analizar patrones');
      return;
    }
    
    const redNumbers = [1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 12, 14, 16, 18, 19, 21, 23, 25, 27, 30, 32, 34, 36];
    
    // Calculate expected percentages based on roulette type
    const expectedRed = this.isEuropean ? 48.65 : 47.37;
    const expectedBlack = this.isEuropean ? 48.65 : 47.37;
    const expectedGreen = this.isEuropean ? 2.70 : 5.26;
    
    // Count colors
    let reds = 0, blacks = 0, greens = 0;
    this.results.forEach(result => {
      if (result === 0 || result === 37) greens++;
      else if (redNumbers.includes(result)) reds++;
      else blacks++;
    });
    
    // Look for "patterns"
    let patterns = [];
    
    // Alternating pattern
    let alternations = 0;
    for (let i = 1; i < this.results.length; i++) {
      const prev = this.results[i-1];
      const curr = this.results[i];
      if ((prev === 0 || prev === 37) || (curr === 0 || curr === 37)) continue;
      
      const prevRed = redNumbers.includes(prev);
      const currRed = redNumbers.includes(curr);
      if (prevRed !== currRed) alternations++;
    }
    
    // Streaks analysis
    let streaks = { red: [], black: [] };
    let currentColor = null;
    let currentCount = 0;
    
    this.results.forEach((result, index) => {
      const color = (result === 0 || result === 37) ? 'green' : 
                   redNumbers.includes(result) ? 'red' : 'black';
      
      if (color === currentColor && color !== 'green') {
        currentCount++;
      } else {
        // Save previous streak if it exists and is not green
        if (currentColor && currentColor !== 'green' && currentCount > 0) {
          streaks[currentColor].push(currentCount);
        }
        // Start new streak
        if (color !== 'green') {
          currentColor = color;
          currentCount = 1;
        } else {
          currentColor = null;
          currentCount = 0;
        }
      }
      
      // Handle last streak
      if (index === this.results.length - 1 && currentColor && currentColor !== 'green' && currentCount > 0) {
        streaks[currentColor].push(currentCount);
      }
    });
    
    this.elements.analysisResults.classList.remove('hidden');
    this.elements.analysisContent.innerHTML = `
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">📊 Distribución de Colores</h4>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-sm">
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-red-600 font-bold">${((reds / this.totalSpins) * 100).toFixed(1)}%</div>
              <div>Rojo (esperado: ${expectedRed}%)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-gray-800 font-bold">${((blacks / this.totalSpins) * 100).toFixed(1)}%</div>
              <div>Negro (esperado: ${expectedBlack}%)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-green-600 font-bold">${((greens / this.totalSpins) * 100).toFixed(1)}%</div>
              <div>Verde (esperado: ${expectedGreen}%)</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">🔍 Análisis de Rachas y Patrones</h4>
          <div class="text-sm space-y-3">
            <div>• Alternaciones R-N-R-N: ${alternations} de ${this.totalSpins - 1} posibles (${alternations > 0 ? ((alternations / (this.totalSpins - 1)) * 100).toFixed(1) : 0}%)</div>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="bg-red-50 p-3 rounded">
                <strong class="text-red-800">Rachas Rojas (${streaks.red.length} total):</strong>
                <div class="text-xs mt-1 space-y-1">
                  <div>• Promedio: ${streaks.red.length > 0 ? (streaks.red.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / streaks.red.length).toFixed(1) : 0} giros</div>
                  <div>• Más larga: ${streaks.red.length > 0 ? Math.max(...streaks.red) : 0} giros</div>
                  <div>• Rachas de 1: ${streaks.red.filter(s => s === 1).length}</div>
                  <div>• Rachas de 2-4: ${streaks.red.filter(s => s >= 2 && s <= 4).length}</div>
                  <div>• Rachas de 5+: ${streaks.red.filter(s => s >= 5).length}</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="bg-gray-100 p-3 rounded">
                <strong class="text-gray-800">Rachas Negras (${streaks.black.length} total):</strong>
                <div class="text-xs mt-1 space-y-1">
                  <div>• Promedio: ${streaks.black.length > 0 ? (streaks.black.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / streaks.black.length).toFixed(1) : 0} giros</div>
                  <div>• Más larga: ${streaks.black.length > 0 ? Math.max(...streaks.black) : 0} giros</div>
                  <div>• Rachas de 1: ${streaks.black.filter(s => s === 1).length}</div>
                  <div>• Rachas de 2-4: ${streaks.black.filter(s => s >= 2 && s <= 4).length}</div>
                  <div>• Rachas de 5+: ${streaks.black.filter(s => s >= 5).length}</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded p-3 mb-3">
          <h5 class="font-bold text-blue-800 mb-2">📊 Contexto Estadístico:</h5>
          <div class="text-blue-700 text-sm space-y-1">
            <div>• <strong>Rachas esperadas:</strong> En ${this.totalSpins} giros, es normal ver rachas de 4-6 consecutivos</div>
            <div>• <strong>Racha de 8:</strong> Probabilidad ≈ 0.4% (1 en 256) - Rara pero normal</div>
            <div>• <strong>Racha de 10:</strong> Probabilidad ≈ 0.1% (1 en 1024) - Muy rara pero posible</div>
            <div>• <strong>Record histórico:</strong> 32 del mismo color (Monte Carlo, 1913)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded p-3">
          <h5 class="font-bold text-red-800 mb-1">🚨 Conclusión del Análisis:</h5>
          <p class="text-red-700 text-sm">
            No se encontraron patrones predecibles. Todas las variaciones observadas están 
            dentro del rango normal de aleatoriedad. <strong>La ruleta no tiene memoria.</strong>
            Las rachas largas son eventos raros pero completamente normales en secuencias aleatorias.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    `;
  }

  reset() {
    this.results = [];
    this.predictions = [];
    this.wrongPredictions = 0;
    this.currentStreak = { type: null, count: 0 };
    this.longestStreaks = { red: 0, black: 0 };
    this.totalSpins = 0;
    
    this.elements.lastResult.textContent = '-';
    this.elements.lastResultColor.textContent = 'Gira para comenzar el experimento';
    this.elements.predictionBox.classList.add('hidden');
    this.elements.analysisResults.classList.add('hidden');
    
    const strip = document.getElementById('rouletteStrip');
    if (strip) {
      strip.style.transform = 'translateX(0px)';
    }
    
    this.updateDisplay();
  }
}

// Add CSS for active states and animations
const style = document.createElement('style');
style.textContent = `
  .active-roulette {
    transform: scale(1.05);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }
  
  #rouletteStrip {
    transition: transform 3s cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);
  }
`;
document.head.appendChild(style);

// Initialize experiment when page loads
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
  new RouletteMemoryExperiment();
});
</script>
